2026-07-27T09:14:28.2887555Z i /tmp/Rtmp82TBRb/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:14:28.2887862Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:14:28.2888134Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:14:28.2888378Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:14:28.2888760Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:14:28.2889315Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:14:28.2890256Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
